Grodu
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
AMA 5 FACE_ALL
AMA 4 FACE_ALL

COLUMN 8 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 2 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 8 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 0 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 6 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 9 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 9 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 1 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE AMA AMA
AND
    DEST Rank 1
    DEST Empty
MOVE {AMA, COLUMN} COLUMN
DEST Rank K
MOVE_STACK AMA COLUMN
DEST Empty
$win
OR
    PILE ALL AMA Empty
    PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
